<h4>Templates for WPBakery Page Builder</h4>
<p>
	We've also made it very easy to create our original demo page layout templates with WPBakery Page Builder. You can choose from these pre made templates: <strong>BuildPress: Front Page</strong>, <strong>BuildPress: Projects</strong>, <strong>BuildPress: Our Services</strong>, <strong>BuildPress: About Us</strong> and <strong>BuildPress: Contact Us</strong>. To recreate the theme front page you need to:
</p>
<ol>
	<li>Create a new page and set the page template to <strong>Front Page With Slider</strong> and set the slider images below the editor.</li>
	<li>In the WPBakery Page Builder editor click on <strong>Templates</strong> icon, click on <strong>Default Templates</strong> tab and then select <strong>BuildPress: Front Page</strong> template:<img src="images/vc_home_page_template.png" alt="WPBakery Page Builder default templates"><img src="images/vc_select_front_page_template.png" alt="WPBakery Page Builder front page template"></li>
	<li>Publish/update the page.</li>
</ol>
